      "source": "Class for creating Consumer callbacks around logging consumer methods.\n\nThis class provides a way to convert methods annotated with <a href=\"../../McpLogging.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpLogging</code></a> into\ncallback functions that can be used to handle logging message notifications. It\nsupports methods with either a single LoggingMessageNotification parameter or three\nparameters (LoggingLevel, String, String).",
      "translation": "用于围绕记录消费者方法创建 Consumer 回调的类。\n\n该类提供了一种将带有 <a href=\"../../McpLogging.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>McpLogging</code></a> 注解的方法转换为可用于处理日志消息通知的回调函数的方法。它支持具有单个 LoggingMessageNotification 参数或三个参数（LoggingLevel、String、String）的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
